>
  <div class="page-head">
    <div class="kicker">Terms</div>
    <h1 class="page-title">Terms of work</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      The full and current agreements are collected in one document:
      <a href="/docs/working-rules-en.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--gold);">Working Rules (PDF)</a>.
