  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Psychological counselling and psychotherapy are not a medical service and do not replace
      treatment by a doctor. I work with adults 18+; I don't work with chemical addictions
      or severe psychiatric diagnoses - and will recommend a psychiatrist when needed.
    </p>
    <p>
      Session length and fees - as per the current terms on this site. Cancellation or
      rescheduling is free 24 hours in advance or earlier; later, the session is paid in full.
      Payment by card, PayPal or IBAN, before or right after the session. A human-language
      version of all the rules is on the <a href="/en/principles/">Working Principles</a> page.
    </p>
  </div>
